1
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:08,682
Repeat, O World, my song.

2
00:00:08,749 --> 00:00:13,047
Echo it over and over again.

3
00:00:13,081 --> 00:00:17,312
Remember, through my joy, each martyr.

4
00:00:17,363 --> 00:00:21,595
Clothe him with the shining mantles
of our festivals.

5
00:00:21,644 --> 00:00:25,577
Repeat O World, my song

6
00:00:26,193 --> 00:00:30,193
In faith and love I am part of mankind,

7
00:00:30,259 --> 00:00:34,757
And I shall march first among the Arabs.

8
00:00:34,797 --> 00:00:39,073
And my heart beat shall remain
that of a Yemenite.

9
00:00:39,123 --> 00:00:46,799
No foreigner shall ever hold
dominion over Yemen.